\newlabel{fig:plausibility}{{2}{5}{Structural plausibility pass rates across sequence sources. Both base and post-GRPO PlasmidLM are clearly distinguishable from random and shuffled controls; the paired $+2.8$ pp gap between pre- and post-GRPO is within paired bootstrap noise ($95\%$ CI $[-1.4, +7.1]$)}{figure.caption.6}{}}
